{
  "_comment": [
    "Cases for a scene member's own labels, meta.description and meta.properties (#818).",
    "Each case's `meta` is merged into member B1's meta after `profile`. `refusal` is the expected",
    "message (ifc write prefixes it with `ifc write: `), or null when the member is accepted; `labels`",
    "is what an accepted member carries: its description, its set name and its properties in key order.",
    "Read by cli/src/render/ifc.rs and by every CAD-host sink's tests (cli-shared/AwareMemberLabels.cs),",
    "so the IFC writer and the Tekla, Revit, Rhino and SketchUp sinks accept and refuse the same members."
